--- Virtual Environment ---

These folders contain thousands of library files.

We don't upload them; we use requirements.txt to recreate them instead.

venv/
env/
.env

--- Python Internals ---

These are temporary compiled files Python creates to run faster.

pycache/
*.py[cod]

--- Database ---

IMPORTANT: Keeps your school data local and private.

*.db

